<title>FRANCE: SOCCER-BRAZIL V ENGLAND TEAMS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-BRAZIL V ENGLAND TEAMS.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Teams for the Tournoi de France match between Brazil and England at Parc des Princes on Tuesday:</p>
<p>England -- 1-David Seaman; 15-Martin Keown, 5-Gareth Southgate, 12-Sol Campbell; 14-Philip Neville, 8-Paul Gascoigne, 19-Paul Scholes, 4-Paul Ince, 6-Graeme Le Saux; 10-Teddy Sheringham, 9-Alan Shearer.</p>
<p>Brazil -- 1-Taffarel; 2-Cafu, 15-Celio Silva, 3-Aldair, 6-Roberto Carlos; 19-Flavio Conceicao, 8-Dunga, 20-Denilson, 10-Leonardo; 11-Romario, 9-Ronaldo.</p>
<p>Referee: John Jairo Toro Rendon (Colombia).</p>
